      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "IK isn't the culprit here, that isn't how that data is transferred. Either way:\n125 kilobytes/second is way, way below what we expect for a broadband connection (typically defined as 25Mbit). I fully expect a 1Mbit connection to have issues. VRChat is pretty bandwidth-hungry!\nIs this a regression from Live? As in, does this issue suddenly occur in Open Beta, but not in Live?",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
