      "value": "@{5acad9ecc9dba010c9c3ec68|full_name}: I've never noticed it happening in Live before, usually I would just have a high ping due to downloading everyone's avatar and then it was gone while this issue keeps happening even after all the avatars are downloaded. I'll see if I can make a comparison during the week-end.",
