      "value": "@{59cb4676d4edc012b9dca22f|full_name}: I mean they already killed a lot of people with poor internet when they first introduced the networked IK. Previously avatar downloading was an issue for most people so they would just block avatars and be mostly okay. now that is not possible.\nI'm lucky here in Australia because I finally got the HFC NBN installed in my area so I'm forced now on 50Mbit down and 20Mbit up. My previous speeds for as long as I can remember were 9Mbit down <1Mbit up and that was painful to play vrchat with even before networked IK.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
