  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2020-01-13T00:18:41.354Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "Hello! \nIt's been twice now where I've played in Open beta (this probably only happen in very populated instances like the community meetup) and my upload speed gets MAXED (my upload speed is 1mbps and maxes out as 125KB/s), making it impossible to interact with anyone because my ping rises up to 1200+.\nA theory was brought up that it was because it was sending my IK to everyone individually and it does seem to hold up, the further I am from people, the more it goes down... Is that going to be optimized?\nThis will kill anyone with a small connection (like me, at least currently) from joining meetups :/",
